config VIDEO_FACETIMEHD
	tristate "Broadcom BCM1570 PCIe FaceTime HD Camera support"
	depends on PCI && VIDEO_DEV
	select VIDEOBUF2_DMA_SG
	help
	  This is a driver for the Broadcom BCM1570 PCIe camera coprocessor
	  found in Apple MacBook Pro and MacBook Air laptops (2013-2015).

	  The camera is connected directly to the PCIe bus and drives an
	  OmniVision OV5650 sensor via MIPI CSI-2 and an AD5816 voice-coil
	  autofocus motor via I2C.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
	  module will be called facetimehd.
